{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong> &quot;Director, Please Give More Guidance&quot; is the world's first director simulator on Steam. You will become a director, going through a series of processes from casting to exploring the inner world of actors, exerting every effort to create a perfect work. Six women with different personalities will bring changes to your movie career. Director, please give more guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong> &quot;Director, Please Give More Guidance&quot; is the world's first director simulator on Steam. You will become a director, experiencing a range of content from casting to uncovering the inner world of actors, striving to produce a flawless piece. Six women with diverse characters will impact your movie journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is she the innocent and lovely campus goddess? <strong>Du Yuchun</strong> Is she the lively and spirited rich girl? <strong>Lin Xiaoxiao</strong> Is she the gentle and graceful intellectual beauty? <strong>Zhu Keke</strong> Is she the pure and charming personal assistant? <strong>Qiao Qiqi</strong> Is she the young and famous rising star? <strong>Sun Qiansong</strong> Is she the domineering and wealthy businesswoman? <strong>Chen Yue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Product Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First - person immersive experience - Experience the joys and sorrows of a director's life in the first person throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple plot branches - Each character brings different story experiences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real - person, real - scene shooting - Fully restore the daily life scenes of a director.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple protagonists to pursue - Six beautiful women with different styles, and the romantic stories between you and them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragra